      "text": [
        "858 - وَ رُوِيَ: «أَنَّهُ إِذَا عَصَفَتِ اَلرِّيحُ بِمَنْ فِي اَلسَّفِينَةِ وَ لَمْ يَقْدِرْ عَلَى أَنْ يَدُورَ إِلَى اَلْقِبْلَةِ صَلَّى إِلَى صَدْرِ اَلسَّفِينَةِ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.858 - It is narrated that \"If the wind blows strongly upon someone on a ship, and they are unable to turn toward the Qiblah, they should pray facing the front of the ship”."
        ]
      }
